    "authors": "Cheng-Ting Yu; Xiaobo Shu; Ya-Dao Wang; Yi-Zhe Zhang; Haoyi Wu; Jiaang Li; Rujiao Long; Ziheng Chen; Yu-Chi Xu; Wen-Bo Su; Bo Zheng",
    "year": "2025",
